@snap_attempt_two_join
title: Join the Sejm nominee under a written coalition agreement
subtitle: Required when Lewica itself supplies the prime minister.
choose-if: snap_formation_nominee_is_left = 1 or coalition_viable_left_ko = 1
unavailable-subtitle: KO and Lewica are too far apart, in trust and in programme, to sign a cabinet agreement; confidence from outside is still on offer.
on-arrival: snap_formation_left_votes = left_committed_seats; snap_left_cabinet_commitment = 1; ko_relation += 3; party_unity += 2; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Lewica accepts cabinet responsibility in the second attempt"
